<!-- Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com> -->
<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="arch" name="System architecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="980" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1828" pageHeight="1543" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;System architecture: Android app with Explorer and Venue roles (MVVM + Firebase/Google)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="180" y="5" width="1488" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="viewL" value="View: Jetpack Compose screens" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="55" width="1728" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="exp" value="&lt;b&gt;Explorer app&lt;/b&gt; (bottom nav: Quests, Map, Profile)&lt;br&gt;Quests tab: accepted quests with their venue and proof status; cancel one, or leave its party; send again a proof that failed to upload&lt;br&gt;Map: quest pins at the quest&#x27;s location, venue pins, filters; nearby quests in a pager or a pulled-up list, accepted from there&lt;br&gt;Quest details: accept, cancel, party code and members, leave, proof status; try again after a refused reservation&lt;br&gt;Join a party by its code&lt;br&gt;Completion: photo or answer inside the radius; offline, the photo waits to upload; send a new one after a rejection&lt;br&gt;Profile: picture, name and join date; set up the first time, then edit; notification settings; sign-out" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="viewL"><mxGeometry x="15" y="32" width="505" height="218" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="expP" value="&lt;i&gt;Later:&lt;/i&gt; companion queue, party chat, ranked matches, result, leaderboard, friends, posts, rank rewards" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="exp"><mxGeometry x="12" y="170" width="481" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="gate" value="&lt;b&gt;Shared by both apps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Login and role gate: sign-in (email, Google), registration with role choice; opens the Explorer or Venue app for the saved role&lt;br&gt;Offline banner over the tabs; actions that need the server are disabled offline&lt;br&gt;Notification prompt, then Android&#x27;s permission dialog" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="viewL"><mxGeometry x="540" y="32" width="220" height="218" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="ven" value="&lt;b&gt;Venue app&lt;/b&gt; (bottom nav: Dashboard, Quests, Profile)&lt;br&gt;Venue entry: loads the owner&#x27;s venue, or runs setup (name and picture, then area on a map with address search)&lt;br&gt;Dashboard: reservations to approve or decline with their party members, approved ones, proofs to review, quest count&lt;br&gt;Quests tab: create, edit or archive a quest (rewards, own location, radius map); a reserved quest keeps its rules, under a banner; says when the server refused a write&lt;br&gt;Proof review: open a proof from the dashboard; approve it, or reject it with a reason&lt;br&gt;Profile: the venue&#x27;s name, address and picture, with Edit details; notification settings; sign-out" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="viewL"><mxGeometry x="780" y="32" width="933" height="218" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="venP" value="&lt;i&gt;Later:&lt;/i&gt; slot settings, past reviews, completion stats, ratings" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="ven"><mxGeometry x="12" y="170" width="909" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="vmL" value="ViewModel (StateFlow)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="353" width="1728" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="expVM" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Explorer ViewModels&lt;/b&gt; (repositories each one calls)&lt;br&gt;MapViewModel: location, quests, venues, connectivity&lt;br&gt;NearbyAcceptViewModel (accept on the map): reservations, users, connectivity, refused writes&lt;br&gt;VenuePageViewModel (accept, cancel, leave): venues, quests, reservations, users, user pictures, party, completions, proof photos, connectivity, proof upload queue, refused writes&lt;br&gt;OverviewViewModel (Quests tab: cancel, leave, send a proof again): reservations, quests, venues, users, party, completions, connectivity, proof upload queue&lt;br&gt;CompletionViewModel (send proof): reservations, quests, venues, location, completions, proof photos, connectivity, proof upload queue&lt;br&gt;JoinPartyViewModel (join by code): party, reservations, quests, venues, connectivity&lt;br&gt;ProfileSetupViewModel (Profile tab, setup and edit): users, user pictures, connectivity" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="vmL"><mxGeometry x="15" y="32" width="505" height="226" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="expVMP" value="&lt;i&gt;Later:&lt;/i&gt; QueueVM, ChatVM, RatingVM, RankVM, FriendsVM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="expVM"><mxGeometry x="12" y="184" width="481" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="authVM" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Shared by both apps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AuthViewModel: auth, ProfileSetup (as RegistrationChoice)&lt;br&gt;SessionViewModel: auth&lt;br&gt;RoleRoutingViewModel: auth, users, ProfileSetup&lt;br&gt;ProfileViewModel (Profile tab, sign-out): auth, proof upload queue, notification tokens and registration&lt;br&gt;OfflineBannerViewModel: connectivity&lt;br&gt;NotificationPermissionViewModel (prompt): prompt store" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="vmL"><mxGeometry x="540" y="32" width="220" height="226" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="venVM" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Venue ViewModels&lt;/b&gt; (repositories each one calls)&lt;br&gt;VenueEntryViewModel: venues&lt;br&gt;VenueInitializationViewModel (setup, Edit details): auth, venues, user pictures&lt;br&gt;VenueAreaViewModel: venues, location, address search&lt;br&gt;VenueProfileViewModel (Profile tab): auth, venues, user pictures&lt;br&gt;CreateQuestViewModel (create, edit, reserved lock): auth, venues, quests, reservations, address search&lt;br&gt;VenueQuestsViewModel (Quests tab, archive): auth, quests, refused quest writes&lt;br&gt;VenueDashboardViewModel (approve, decline): auth, reservations, quests, venues, users, user pictures, party, completions, connectivity&lt;br&gt;ReviewProofViewModel (approve, reject): auth, completions, reservations, party, quests, proof photos, connectivity" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="vmL"><mxGeometry x="780" y="32" width="933" height="226" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="venVMP" value="&lt;i&gt;Later:&lt;/i&gt; ReviewVM (past reviews), StatsVM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="venVM"><mxGeometry x="12" y="184" width="909" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="modelL" value="Model: repositories" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="673" width="1728" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="laterR" value="&lt;b&gt;Later&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;RouteRepo, ChatRepo, RatingRepo, PostRepo (posts, reports), RankRepo, StatsRepo on Firestore" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="modelL"><mxGeometry x="15" y="32" width="194" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="devR" value="&lt;b&gt;Device&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="modelL"><mxGeometry x="219" y="32" width="194" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="locRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;LocationRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;current location; radius check" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="devR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="178" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="addrRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;AddressSearchRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;address search in venue setup" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="devR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="74" width="178" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="connRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;ConnectivityRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;online or offline (offline banner, actions disabled offline)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="devR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="120" width="178" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="accR" value="&lt;b&gt;Account&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="modelL"><mxGeometry x="423" y="32" width="300" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="authRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;AuthRepository&lt;/b&gt;: email and Google sign-in, current session" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="accR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="284" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="userRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;UserRepository&lt;/b&gt;: profiles (display name, write-once role)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="accR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="64" width="284" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="picRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;UserPictureRepository&lt;/b&gt;: uploads and loads user and venue pictures" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="accR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="100" width="284" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="setupRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;ProfileSetup&lt;/b&gt; with &lt;b&gt;PendingRoleStore&lt;/b&gt;: keeps the role chosen at registration until the profile is saved" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="accR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="146" width="284" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="vqR" value="&lt;b&gt;Venues and quests&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="modelL"><mxGeometry x="733" y="32" width="186" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="venueRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;VenueRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;a venue writes its own name, area and picture; everyone signed in reads" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="vqR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="170" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="questRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;QuestRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;create, update (including archive); the quest&#x27;s own location, or else the venue&#x27;s" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="vqR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="88" width="170" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="refusedQRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;RefusedQuestWrites&lt;/b&gt; with &lt;b&gt;RefusedQuestWritesStore&lt;/b&gt;: quest writes the server refused, told once, across restarts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="vqR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="158" width="170" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="resR" value="&lt;b&gt;Reservations&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="modelL"><mxGeometry x="929" y="32" width="186" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="resRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;ReservationRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;create; observe per explorer or venue; update status; find by code; party preview" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="resR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="170" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="partyRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;PartyRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;party_user memberships: join, withdraw (a member leaves), members" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="resR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="100" width="170" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="refusedRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;RefusedWrites&lt;/b&gt; with &lt;b&gt;RefusedWritesStore&lt;/b&gt;: reservations the server refused, remembered across restarts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="resR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="162" width="170" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="compR" value="&lt;b&gt;Completions&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="modelL"><mxGeometry x="1125" y="32" width="328" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="compModel" value="&lt;b&gt;Completion&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;Proof&lt;/b&gt; models; a rejected proof can be sent again" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="compR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="312" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="compRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;CompletionRepository&lt;/b&gt;: submit a proof; observe per explorer, venue or reservation; approve or reject" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="compR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="68" width="312" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="photoRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;ProofPhotoRepository&lt;/b&gt;: uploads and downloads proof photos" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="compR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="114" width="312" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="queueRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;ProofUploadQueue&lt;/b&gt;: a photo proof taken offline waits; &lt;b&gt;ProofUploadWorker&lt;/b&gt; uploads it through ProofPhotoRepository and submits it through CompletionRepository once online, even after a restart" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="compR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="156" width="312" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="notifR" value="&lt;b&gt;Notifications&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=4;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="modelL"><mxGeometry x="1463" y="32" width="250" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="tokenRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;NotificationTokenRepository&lt;/b&gt;: saves this phone&#x27;s ID under its user; deleted at sign-out" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="notifR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="28" width="234" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="regRepo" value="&lt;b&gt;NotificationRegistration&lt;/b&gt;: registers the phone with FCM, gives its ID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="notifR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="74" width="234" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="registrar" value="&lt;b&gt;NotificationTokenRegistrar&lt;/b&gt;: at each sign-in, saves the ID FCM answers with" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="notifR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="110" width="234" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="msgService" value="&lt;b&gt;AroundMessagingService&lt;/b&gt; receives FCM&#x27;s messages; &lt;b&gt;NotificationPoster&lt;/b&gt; shows them, one channel per kind" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="notifR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="150" width="234" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="promptStore" value="&lt;b&gt;NotificationPromptStore&lt;/b&gt;: whether the prompt was answered" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="notifR"><mxGeometry x="8" y="196" width="234" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="dataL" value="Services: Firebase, Google and Android" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1103" width="1728" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cm" value="&lt;b&gt;Credential Manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Google account chooser, Google ID token" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="15" y="10" width="92" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="maps" value="&lt;b&gt;Google Maps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maps SDK (Compose)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="117" y="10" width="92" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="loc" value="&lt;b&gt;Fused location&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Play services)&lt;br&gt;GPS: the app&#x27;s sensor" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="219" y="10" width="92" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="geo" value="&lt;b&gt;Android Geocoder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;address search" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="327" y="10" width="86" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="connS" value="&lt;b&gt;Connectivity Manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;network state" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="327" y="62" width="86" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="prefs" value="&lt;b&gt;Shared Preferences&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;on device: the four *Store interfaces" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="423" y="10" width="92" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="auth" value="&lt;b&gt;Firebase Auth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;email, Google" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="525" y="10" width="92" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="fs" value="&lt;b&gt;Firestore&lt;/b&gt;: offline cache; security rules v2 check roles, fields and status changes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="627" y="10" width="671" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_users" value="users" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="fs"><mxGeometry x="8" y="10" width="85" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_venues" value="venues" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="fs"><mxGeometry x="103" y="10" width="85" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_quests" value="quests" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="fs"><mxGeometry x="198" y="10" width="85" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_res" value="reservations" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="fs"><mxGeometry x="293" y="10" width="85" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_party" value="party_user" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="fs"><mxGeometry x="388" y="10" width="85" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_comp" value="completions" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="fs"><mxGeometry x="483" y="10" width="85" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c_tokens" value="users/{uid}/&lt;br&gt;tokens" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="fs"><mxGeometry x="578" y="10" width="85" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="storage" value="&lt;b&gt;Cloud Storage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;proof photos, user and venue pictures; storage rules" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="1308" y="10" width="92" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="wm" value="&lt;b&gt;WorkManager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Jetpack)&lt;br&gt;proof uploads, kept across restarts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="10" width="92" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="fcm" value="&lt;b&gt;Firebase Cloud Messaging&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;registers the phone under its Firebase Installation ID; delivers the functions&#x27; data messages" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="1512" y="10" width="201" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="laterCF" value="&lt;b&gt;Later&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more Cloud Functions: points, GPS check, moderation, matching, expiry" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="627" y="140" width="200" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cf" value="&lt;b&gt;Cloud Functions&lt;/b&gt; (functions/src, TypeScript, europe-west1): Firestore triggers that notify through &lt;b&gt;sendToUser&lt;/b&gt; (notify.ts), which reads the user&#x27;s phone IDs in users/{uid}/tokens, sends each phone a data message with FCM, and deletes the IDs of phones that are gone&lt;br&gt;To the venue: notifyVenueReservation (a party reserves), notifyVenueCancellation (the party cancels), notifyVenueProof (a proof is sent)&lt;br&gt;To the party: notifyReservationAnswered (approved or declined), notifyProofAnswered (proof approved or rejected)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="dataL"><mxGeometry x="837" y="140" width="876" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lg1" value="Built on main" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1387" width="200" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lg3" value="Later: backlog, not scheduled" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="1387" width="200" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lg4" value="Arrows from ViewModels to repositories: &lt;font color=&quot;#2f6db5&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;blue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; from the Explorer ViewModels, &lt;font color=&quot;#c25e00&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;orange&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; from the Venue ViewModels, &lt;b&gt;black&lt;/b&gt; from the shared ones; each ViewModel line names the repositories it calls." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="1387" width="1298" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend" value="Solid arrows: calls (the View calls ViewModel methods, ViewModels call repositories, repositories call services). Dashed black arrows: the View observes a ViewModel StateFlow. Each ViewModel line names the repositories it calls; one arrow per group stands for those calls. Arrows to services are labelled with the repository that calls them; two-headed arrows read and write, with realtime listeners and the Firestore offline cache. Each repository is an interface with one implementation (Firestore, Firebase Auth, Cloud Storage, WorkManager, FCM, Shared Preferences or Android) built by a Provider, and a fake for tests; RefusedWrites and RefusedQuestWrites are classes over a store interface. Map screens (explorer map, venue area, quest radius and location, quest details) use the Maps SDK directly; the completion screen opens the camera and photo picker itself; the explorer&#x27;s Profile tab is given UserPictureRepository to show and upload the picture. The login screen gets the Google ID token from Credential Manager and passes it to AuthViewModel. The role is a write-once field of the user document; Firestore rules v2 check it on venue, quest and reservation writes. A party_user membership decides who reads a reservation and sends its proof; storage rules read it from Firestore, and let a user or a venue write only their own picture. ReservationRepository and PartyRepository each write reservations and party_user together, in one batch or transaction. PendingRoleStore, RefusedWritesStore, RefusedQuestWritesStore and NotificationPromptStore keep their data in Shared Preferences; they have no arrow, to keep the picture readable. Firestore keeps writes made offline and sends them later; RefusedWrites and RefusedQuestWrites remember, across restarts, which ones the rules refused, so the screens can say so. Offline, a photo proof goes to ProofUploadQueue, and WorkManager runs ProofUploadWorker once the phone is online. MainActivity starts NotificationTokenRegistrar, which registers the phone with FCM at each sign-in and saves its ID; ProfileViewModel deletes it at sign-out. The Cloud Functions send data-only messages, so AroundMessagingService shows each one itself." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1419" width="1468" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
